                    <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#C5A059] font-semibold">Jury Trial Verdict (2026)</span>
                    <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif text-white mt-1">City of Phoenix v. Crescent 2400</h2>
                </div>
                <div class="text-right">
                    <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 block">Total Recovery</span>
                    <span class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-400">$5,700,000</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
                The City condemned a portion of land from an office building. The City’s initial appraisal was approximately $680,000. Following trial, the jury awarded nearly $3.8MM, alongside $1.1MM in interest and $765,000 in sanctions against the City.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Case Item: State of Arizona v. Foothills -->
        <div class="bg-[#101B26] border border-slate-800 rounded-lg p-8 shadow-xl hover:border-[#C5A059]/50 transition">
            <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-4">
