                    <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#C5A059] font-semibold">Settlement (2025)</span>
                    <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif text-white mt-1">State of Arizona v. Foothills (ADOT)</h2>
                </div>
                <div class="text-right">
                    <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 block">Total Recovery</span>
                    <span class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-400">$30,000,000+</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
                ADOT condemned permanent open space owned by a homeowners association, appraising the land at $2,088,000. Successfully settled for $26,500,000 plus over $4,000,000 in statutory interest.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Case Item: City of Scottsdale v. Toll Brothers -->
        <div class="bg-[#101B26] border border-slate-800 rounded-lg p-8 shadow-xl hover:border-[#C5A059]/50 transition">
            <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-4">
                <div>
                    <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#C5A059] font-semibold">Landmark Jury Trial (2008)</span>
                    <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif text-white mt-1">City of Scottsdale v. Toll Brothers</h2>
                </div>
                <div class="text-right">
                    <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 block">Total Award</span>
                    <span class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-400">$91,000,000</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
                Condemnation of approximately 384 acres for a desert preserve. After a grueling 3-week trial where the City appraised the property at $33.8MM, the jury awarded nearly $82,000,000 plus $9M+ in statutory interest. <strong class="text-white">This stands as the largest condemnation verdict in Arizona history.</strong>
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Case Item: City of Phoenix v. Garretson -->
        <div class="bg-[#101B26] border border-slate-800 rounded-lg p-8 shadow-xl hover:border-[#C5A059]/50 transition">
